flowchart TD

    A["Is there an armed conflict?  
    (IHL applies if intensity + organization are met)"]

    B["NO ARMED CONFLICT  
    → Domestic law applies  
    → Killing is murder unless self-defense  
    Authority:  
    - 18 USC §1111 (Murder)  
    - UCMJ Art. 118"]

    C["Identify status of person:  
    - Combatant  
    - Civilian  
    - Civilian Directly Participating  
    - Hors de combat  
    - Shipwrecked  
    - Surrendering  
    - Detained"]

    D["WAR CRIME  
    Attack on hors de combat / shipwrecked / wounded / surrendered  
    Authority:  
    - GC II Art. 12  
    - Customary IHL Rule 47  
    - 18 USC §2441"]

    E["WAR CRIME  
    Attack on civilian not participating  
    Authority:  
    - AP I Art. 51  
    - Customary IHL Rules 1 and 6  
    - 18 USC §2441"]

    F["Civilian Directly Participating  
    → Targetable only during participation  
    Authority:  
    - ICRC DPH Guidance  
    - Customary IHL Rule 6  
    - San Remo Manual 39–41"]

    G["Combatant capable of hostile action  
    → Lawful target  
    Authority:  
    - GC III  
    - San Remo Manual 40–43  
    - US Navy NWP 1-14M"]

    H["Status in doubt  
    → Presume civilian  
    Authority:  
    - AP I Art. 50  
    - Customary IHL Rule 6"]

    %% Connections
    A -->|"No"| B

    A -->|"Yes"| C

    C -->|"Hors de combat / shipwrecked / surrendering"| D

    C -->|"Civilian not participating"| E

    C -->|"Civilian directly participating"| F

    C -->|"Combatant able to fight"| G

    C -->|"Uncertain status"| H
